            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Exterminator takes place inside a Japanese Game Show, and you are the contestant! <br />\r\nThe objective is to take down the mischevious mice from all directions. <br />\r\nThis is a game where you can relieve stress and get a workout at the same time! This is what Exterminator is all about.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe rules are simple. The goal is to punch out as many mice as you can within the time limit to earn points.<br />\r\nStrive for the top ranking while getting a nice sweat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnyone can enjoy a refreshing experience playing Exterminator!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMouse Collection<br />\r\nThere are many types of mice, each brining their own unique personalities.<br />\r\nDefeat them to collect their card. Try and collect them all!",
            "about_the_game": "Exterminator takes place inside a Japanese Game Show, and you are the contestant! <br />\r\nThe objective is to take down the mischevious mice from all directions. <br />\r\nThis is a game where you can relieve stress and get a workout at the same time! This is what Exterminator is all about.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe rules are simple. The goal is to punch out as many mice as you can within the time limit to earn points.<br />\r\nStrive for the top ranking while getting a nice sweat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnyone can enjoy a refreshing experience playing Exterminator!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMouse Collection<br />\r\nThere are many types of mice, each brining their own unique personalities.<br />\r\nDefeat them to collect their card. Try and collect them all!",
            "short_description": "Enjoy the world of a Japanese Game Show through an arcade experience! Punch the mouse coming from pipes to earn points. Anyone can enjoy a refreshing experience playing Exterminator!",
